{"subtitleNullable":"Multi-sport betting odds from 8+ bookmakers — a clean, flattened snapshot for an","creatorNameNullable":"harsh singh","totalBytesNullable":22007,"licenseNameNullable":"CC0: Public Domain","descriptionNullable":"# Live Sports Betting Odds Snapshot\n\nA real-time snapshot of sports betting odds collected from **The Odds API** (via RapidAPI) on **19 June 2026**.\n\nEach row represents a single betting outcome — one team, one bookmaker, one market type. The original API returns deeply nested JSON, which has been flattened here into a clean, analysis-ready table.\n\n## Sports Included\n- **Baseball** — MLB \u0026 MiLB\n- **Tennis** — ATP Halle Open\n- **Soccer** — FIFA World Cup \u0026 League of Ireland\n- **MMA** — Mixed Martial Arts\n- **Lacrosse** — PLL (Premier Lacrosse League)\n\n## Columns\n| Column | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| sport_title | Name of the sport / league |\n| commence_time | Match start time (UTC) |\n| home_team | Home team |\n| away_team | Away team |\n| bookmaker | Name of the betting site |\n| market | Bet type — `h2h` (moneyline) or `spreads` (handicap) |\n| team | The team this odd refers to |\n| price | Decimal odds |\n| point | Spread line (empty/NaN for h2h bets) |\n\n## Notes\n- Odds change in real time — this is a one-time snapshot, not live data.\n- `point` is empty for `h2h` rows; this is expected, not missing data.\n- Decimal odds: implied probability = 1 / price.\n\n## Possible Uses\n- Compare odds across bookmakers for the same match\n- Find best available price per team\n- Detect arbitrage opportunities\n- Practice flattening nested JSON \u0026 exploratory data analysis","ownerNameNullable":"harsh singh","ownerRefNullable":"harsh21x","titleNullable":"Live Sports Betting Odds Snapshot","currentVersionNumberNullable":1,"usabilityRatingNullable":0.64705884,"thumbnailImageUrlNullable":"https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-datasets-images/new-version-temp-images/default-backgrounds-19.png-29057327/dataset-thumbnail.png","id":10811746,"ref":"harsh21x/live-sports-betting-odds-snapshot","subtitle":"Multi-sport betting odds from 8+ bookmakers — a clean, flattened snapshot for an","hasSubtitle":true,"creatorName":"harsh singh","hasCreatorName":true,"creatorUrl":"","hasCreatorUrl":false,"totalBytes":22007,"hasTotalBytes":true,"url":"","hasUrl":false,"lastUpdated":"2026-06-19T21:32:45.723Z","downloadCount":84,"isPrivate":false,"isFeatured":false,"licenseName":"CC0: Public Domain","hasLicenseName":true,"description":"# Live Sports Betting Odds Snapshot\n\nA real-time snapshot of sports betting odds collected from **The Odds API** (via RapidAPI) on **19 June 2026**.\n\nEach row represents a single betting outcome — one team, one bookmaker, one market type. The original API returns deeply nested JSON, which has been flattened here into a clean, analysis-ready table.\n\n## Sports Included\n- **Baseball** — MLB \u0026 MiLB\n- **Tennis** — ATP Halle Open\n- **Soccer** — FIFA World Cup \u0026 League of Ireland\n- **MMA** — Mixed Martial Arts\n- **Lacrosse** — PLL (Premier Lacrosse League)\n\n## Columns\n| Column | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| sport_title | Name of the sport / league |\n| commence_time | Match start time (UTC) |\n| home_team | Home team |\n| away_team | Away team |\n| bookmaker | Name of the betting site |\n| market | Bet type — `h2h` (moneyline) or `spreads` (handicap) |\n| team | The team this odd refers to |\n| price | Decimal odds |\n| point | Spread line (empty/NaN for h2h bets) |\n\n## Notes\n- Odds change in real time — this is a one-time snapshot, not live data.\n- `point` is empty for `h2h` rows; this is expected, not missing data.\n- Decimal odds: implied probability = 1 / price.\n\n## Possible Uses\n- Compare odds across bookmakers for the same match\n- Find best available price per team\n- Detect arbitrage opportunities\n- Practice flattening nested JSON \u0026 exploratory data analysis","hasDescription":true,"ownerName":"harsh singh","